but lost the war in the process.

273
00:14:44,580 --> 00:14:46,280
From the looks of things,

274
00:14:46,340 --> 00:14:47,540
you didn't even win the battle.

275
00:14:47,960 --> 00:14:48,820
You're all for two.

276
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:51,180
I knew it!

277
00:14:51,360 --> 00:14:52,880
You have to be Afro, Yamada.

278
00:14:53,380 --> 00:14:54,400
You got me.

279
00:14:55,180 --> 00:14:55,800
By the way,

280
00:14:55,920 --> 00:14:56,780
can I go home now?

281
00:14:57,160 --> 00:14:58,200
Yep, that's Yamada.

282
00:14:58,900 --> 00:15:00,440
Would it kill you to keep me company?

283
00:15:00,660 --> 00:15:02,480
I really don't want to be alone right now!

284
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:03,480
Whoa!

285
00:15:03,480 --> 00:15:03,680
Whoa!

286
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:10,700
That girl...

287
00:15:10,700 --> 00:15:13,820
She was a real knockout.

288
00:15:14,540 --> 00:15:15,320
Who now?

289
00:15:16,460 --> 00:15:17,500
Takuma's girlfriend.

290
00:15:18,040 --> 00:15:19,460
Who's Takuma?

291
00:15:19,800 --> 00:15:20,600
My ex!

292
00:15:20,680 --> 00:15:21,600
You know this already!

293
00:15:21,800 --> 00:15:23,480
I told you about him in the game, chat!

294
00:15:25,060 --> 00:15:25,860
Oh...

295
00:15:25,860 --> 00:15:27,460
Now it's clicking.

296
00:15:27,880 --> 00:15:29,380
You're that inept paladin, huh?

297
00:15:29,380 --> 00:15:31,220
You just put that together?

298
00:15:31,620 --> 00:15:32,060
Well,

299
00:15:32,380 --> 00:15:34,460
it's a miracle that I realized it at all.

300
00:15:36,280 --> 00:15:36,840
Welcome!

301
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:40,660
The truth is,

302
00:15:41,040 --> 00:15:42,440
today I got all dressed up

303
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:44,140
to flaunt myself around the event

304
00:15:44,140 --> 00:15:45,920
and make him regret dumping me.

305
00:15:47,620 --> 00:15:48,380
But...

306
00:15:48,380 --> 00:15:52,380
I didn't plan on having to see them together like that.

307
00:15:52,380 --> 00:16:00,580
That's rough stuff.

308
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:04,620
Since we're gonna be here a while,

309
00:16:04,820 --> 00:16:06,260
would you mind if I ordered another Coke?

310
00:16:06,440 --> 00:16:07,220
Be my guest!

311
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:08,320
It's my pleasure!

312
00:16:10,160 --> 00:16:11,940
I'm starting to get drained.

313
00:16:12,780 --> 00:16:13,420
By the way,

314
00:16:13,500 --> 00:16:14,920
about what Takuma said before,

315
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:16,440
what exactly is a pro gamer?

316
00:16:16,940 --> 00:16:19,020
There's someone who gets paid by sponsors

317
00:16:19,020 --> 00:16:20,440
to play games, I guess.

318
00:16:20,440 --> 00:16:22,520
Sponsors?

319
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:23,220
For real?

320
00:16:23,480 --> 00:16:24,680
Yeah, that's how it works.

321
00:16:24,980 --> 00:16:27,440
Then you're getting paid to play FOSS, too?

322
00:16:27,660 --> 00:16:28,900
That's just a break for me.

323
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:31,160
I mainly play FPS games.

324
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:32,840
Oh?

325
00:16:33,380 --> 00:16:34,860
And those would be...

326
00:16:34,860 --> 00:16:36,500
Uh, don't worry about it.

327
00:16:39,460 --> 00:16:39,940
Hmm.

328
00:16:41,520 --> 00:16:43,780
Don't you think you're a little bit too cold, Yamada?

329
00:16:44,280 --> 00:16:46,900
You won't be popular with the girls acting like that.

330
00:16:47,300 --> 00:16:48,180
You're right, I'm not.

331
00:16:48,560 --> 00:16:50,020
I've never even had a girlfriend.

332
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:51,080
Huh?

333
00:16:51,300 --> 00:16:51,680
What?

334
00:16:51,740 --> 00:16:52,320
No way!

335
00:16:53,040 --> 00:16:55,220
But you just said girls wouldn't like my attitude.

336
00:16:55,840 --> 00:16:57,660
Never mind that, you're missing the point!

337
00:16:57,920 --> 00:16:58,760
With your good looks,

338
00:16:58,820 --> 00:17:00,160
how can you not be in high demand?

339
00:17:01,300 --> 00:17:02,400
Well, honestly,

340
00:17:02,860 --> 00:17:03,800
I'm not interested

341
00:17:03,800 --> 00:17:05,600
in the whole romance thing.

342
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:07,140
Oh my.

343
00:17:08,560 --> 00:17:10,380
What a waste of a pretty face.

344
00:17:10,940 --> 00:17:12,740
Gaming is just more fun for me.

345
00:17:12,740 --> 00:17:13,440
Wow.

346
00:17:15,600 --> 00:17:19,700
I suppose romance isn't always sunshine and rainbows either.

347
00:17:20,120 --> 00:17:21,560
Me getting cheated on in the game

348
00:17:21,560 --> 00:17:23,040
should be plenty proof of that.

349
00:17:23,200 --> 00:17:23,900
Must suck.

350
00:17:25,560 --> 00:17:27,020
It does suck.

351
00:17:30,060 --> 00:17:30,580
Uh-oh.

352
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:32,540
I feel tears coming on.

353
00:17:33,580 --> 00:17:34,640
Pardon me a sec.

354
00:17:34,640 --> 00:17:36,440
I need to use the ladies' room.

355
00:17:47,820 --> 00:17:48,340
Huh?

356
00:17:48,740 --> 00:17:50,360
My clothes are all dirty.

357
00:17:51,160 --> 00:17:53,000
It must have happened when I tripped earlier.

358
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:58,580
Oh, great.

359
00:17:58,820 --> 00:18:00,060
I scraped my leg, too.

360
00:18:02,280 --> 00:18:09,560
I wish I hadn't gone to that event.

361
00:18:09,560 --> 00:18:12,600
If I knew I was gonna end up feeling like this,

362
00:18:12,940 --> 00:18:14,340
I would have steered clear.

363
00:18:22,340 --> 00:18:23,280
Wait a second.

364
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:25,560
Where'd he go?

365
00:18:26,360 --> 00:18:28,260
Don't tell me he ditched me.

366
00:18:29,320 --> 00:18:30,960
I wouldn't put it past him.

367
00:18:31,340 --> 00:18:33,260
He was just dying to go home.

368
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:36,320
Not that it matters, I guess.

369
00:18:36,780 --> 00:18:38,200
He was only sticking around

370
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:39,480
because I forced him to.

371
00:18:39,560 --> 00:18:42,600
Better get used to it.

372
00:18:42,960 --> 00:18:45,120
Being alone's gonna be my new normal.

373
00:18:49,820 --> 00:18:50,840
Are you okay?

374
00:18:54,840 --> 00:18:55,320
Uh...

375
00:18:55,320 --> 00:18:58,840
Why are you looking at me like that?

376
00:19:02,680 --> 00:19:04,960
Uh...

377
00:19:04,960 --> 00:19:07,020
So, would you mind taking a seat for a minute?

378
00:19:09,560 --> 00:19:16,400
Where did those come from?

379
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:17,620
The band-aids?

380
00:19:18,180 --> 00:19:20,100
I went out and picked them up real quick.

381
00:19:20,100 --> 00:19:23,420
Crap.

382
00:19:23,500 --> 00:19:24,380
It's sticking.

383
00:19:25,660 --> 00:19:27,180
I'm just gonna put it on.

384
00:19:27,180 --> 00:19:39,640
You went out to buy these for me?

385
00:19:39,640 --> 00:19:43,740
I got worried once I noticed the blood coming from your ankle, so...

386
00:19:43,740 --> 00:19:45,620
So that made you rush to get them?

387
00:19:46,460 --> 00:19:46,980
Well...

388
00:19:47,740 --> 00:19:48,580
That and...

389
00:19:48,580 --> 00:19:50,380
I drank like three cokes, you know.

390
00:19:55,860 --> 00:19:56,700
Yamada!

391
00:19:58,780 --> 00:20:00,340
I'll treat you to anything!

392
00:20:00,900 --> 00:20:02,060
But I wanna go home now.

393
00:20:02,060 --> 00:20:03,860
We're so good at drink tonight!

394
00:20:03,940 --> 00:20:04,420
Uh...

395
00:20:04,420 --> 00:20:05,000
Um...

396
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:06,580
May we place an order, please?

397
00:20:06,980 --> 00:20:08,040
Yep, you got it!

398
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:21,780
Tani's scouting the area, so let's change it up.

399
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:30,240
We can focus on the enemies in front.

400
00:20:30,240 --> 00:20:36,640
Might be able to wreck him some kills.

401
00:20:38,680 --> 00:20:40,640
My head hurts.

402
00:20:41,980 --> 00:20:43,780
The next map in particular.

403
00:20:45,120 --> 00:20:46,280
Is that...

404
00:20:46,280 --> 00:20:48,680
Yeah, someone's talking.

405
00:20:49,560 --> 00:20:51,880
I told you, I'm not turning on my camera.

406
00:20:54,180 --> 00:20:55,660
Who is it?

407
00:20:55,660 --> 00:20:58,820
This is getting old.

408
00:21:08,980 --> 00:21:09,660
Hey, uh...

409
00:21:11,020 --> 00:21:11,640
My bad.

410
00:21:11,840 --> 00:21:13,040
I'm gonna go AFK.

411
00:21:13,980 --> 00:21:14,720
Be right back.

412
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:54,000
I don't know what to do, but I don't know what to do, but I don't know what to do, but I don't know what to do.

413
00:22:54,000 --> 00:22:58,000
These hairstyles being free is great and all, but none of them are cute.

414
00:22:58,000 --> 00:23:05,000
You can only get the most appealing ones from loot boxes. Fat chance I'd ever win one, though.

415
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:15,000
What? They also sell them for a fixed price? Not as good as the loot boxes, but cuter than the defaults.

416
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:20,000
I see. You can acquire them this way to show off some personality at least.

417
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:26,000
I bought the cutest one I could find at a fixed price!

418
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:27,000
Huh?

419
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:37,000
We all had the same exact thought.

